    - target: {fileID: 436626590693150680, guid: abdbadfbf1dbb754c84194bfe4cb6328, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _clueString
      value: 'I have no eyes, yet I always gaze in one direction.

        I have
        no legs, yet I lead the way for every traveler.

        Alone in the deep
        sea or the dense forest, men trust me more than they trust themselves.

        What
        am I?'
